3561  B700              ; bshow, bank 3's: its pairs at the shift, 22 patterns from 1, with OTIR;
3562  B700              ; and when fresh says the bank is new, their colours. Uses A, BC, HL
3563  B700              bshow3: VRAM_WRITE $0008        ; 40  pair 1's pattern, the first
3563  B700 3E 08       >        ld a, low ($0008)
3563  B702 D3 99       >        out (VDP_CTRL), a
