6798  B700              ; bshow, bank 6's: its pairs at the shift, 22 patterns from 1, with OTIR;
6799  B700              ; and when fresh says the bank is new, their colours. Uses A, BC, HL
6800  B700              bshow6: VRAM_WRITE $0008        ; 40  pair 1's pattern, the first
6800  B700 3E 08       >        ld a, low ($0008)
6800  B702 D3 99       >        out (VDP_CTRL), a
6800  B704 3E 40       >        ld a, high ($0008) | $40
